Work with YouTrack issues

<bold>Usage:</>
  <accent>ytrack issue</> <command> [flags]
  <accent>ytrack issue</> [command]

<bold>Available Commands:</>
  <accent>activities </> Show the history of an issue
  <accent>attach     </> Attach files to an issue
  <accent>attachments</> List the attachments of an issue
  <accent>command    </> Apply a YouTrack command to one or more issues
  <accent>comment    </> Add, list, edit or delete issue comments
  <accent>count      </> Count the issues that match a query
  <accent>create     </> Create an issue
  <accent>delete     </> Delete an issue
  <accent>download   </> Download the attachments of an issue
  <accent>edit       </> Edit an issue
  <accent>link       </> Link issues, or list an issue's links or the link types
  <accent>list       </> List issues
  <accent>unlink     </> Remove links between issues
  <accent>unvote     </> Remove your vote from an issue
  <accent>unwatch    </> Remove your star from an issue
  <accent>view       </> Show an issue
  <accent>vote       </> Vote for an issue
  <accent>watch      </> Star an issue to get its notifications
  <accent>watchers   </> List the users who watch an issue

<bold>Flags:</>
  <accent>-h, --help</><dim>[=true|false]</>   help for issue

<bold>Global Flags:</>
      <accent>--debug</><dim>[=true|false]</>      Log HTTP requests to stderr with credentials redacted
      <accent>--host</><dim> host</>               YouTrack host or service URL to use
      <accent>--no-color</><dim>[=true|false]</>   Disable color output

<dim>Use "ytrack issue [command] --help" for more information about a command.</>
